OL,4,CYemeni city: 'fireworks              W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GIn the Yemeni city of Taiz, ringed   W5
OL,7,Gby jagged mountains and Houthi rebel W5
OL,8,Gfighters, Ashwaq has only one way to W5
OL,9,Gtry to soothe her frightened child - W5
OL,10,Glie.                                 W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,G"When my 11-year-old son hears a     W5
OL,13,Gloud sound, I tell him, 'Don't be    W5
OL,14,Gafraid, it's just fireworks'," she   W5
OL,15,Gsays. "I don't want him to panic,    W5
OL,16,Gbut deep down I know he is old       W5
OL,17,Genough to understand what is         W5
OL,18,Ghappening around him. He has lived   W5
OL,19,Gthrough war for most of his life."   W5
